Package: com.openai.codex-ios
Name: Codex iOS (Rootless)
Version: 0.168.0-2+rootless
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: davgz
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), dash, ca-certificates, git, ripgrep
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Description: Native Codex CLI for rootless jailbroken iOS
 Installs Codex 0.168.0 and its native code-mode host under /var/jb.
 The matching native runtimes do not require Node.js or npm.
 Updates require an iOS-native package; npm does not update this binary.
